ptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qiangxue/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"milestoned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-11-22T23:20:33Z","milestone":{"title":"2.0.x"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/169149275","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/6173#issuecomment-169149275","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/6173","id":169149275,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2OTE0OTI3NQ==","user":{"login":"wallysalami","id":2084188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODQxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2084188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami","html_url":"https://github.com/wallysalami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-01-05T22:08:13Z","updated_at":"2016-01-06T11:33:25Z","body":"How is the status in this issue? I found the exact same problem here. The proposed solution is working, so I'm using child class\n\n``` php\n<?php\n\nnamespace app\\components;\nuse yii\\web\\DbSession;\n\nclass MyDbSession extends DbSession\n{\n    public function readSession($id)\n    {\n        $data = parent::readSession($id);\n        if ($data === false) {\n            return false;\n        }\n\n        return base64_decode($data);\n    }\n\n    public function writeSession($id, $data)\n    {\n        return parent::writeSession($id, base64_encode($data));\n    }\n}\n\n```\n\nand setting it in `config/web.php`\n\n``` php\n'session' => [\n    'class'        => 'app\\components\\MyDbSession',\n    'sessionTable' => 'session_frontend',\n    'cookieParams' => [\n        'httponly'  => true,\n    ],\n    'timeout'      => 7200, // Session (the login cookie) expires after 2 hours of inactivity\n],\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/169149275/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wallysalami","id":2084188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODQxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2084188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami","html_url":"https://github.com/wallysalami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site