ould fix it.\nAs far as I see, we can deal with the problem by introducing the additional boolean property `encodeSession` to `yii\\web\\DbSession` and encode/decode the payload when the property is set to true.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/169305415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SilverFire","id":4499203,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0OTkyMDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4499203?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverFire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverFire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/169401135","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/6173#issuecomment-169401135","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/6173","id":169401135,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE2OTQwMTEzNQ==","user":{"login":"wallysalami","id":2084188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODQxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2084188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami","html_url":"https://github.com/wallysalami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-01-06T17:45:47Z","updated_at":"2016-01-06T17:46:02Z","body":"It is one possible solution. Two observations here:\n- We had this problem in Yii 1 and we changed the `data` column to `TEXT` type. That didn't work in Yii 2.\n- Maybe you could check the database type and, if it is PostgreSQL, you would apply encode/decode. But it would be interesting to check which databases have that problem.\n\nA `encodeSession`is probably a good solution, anyway. Just make a friendly explanation in the documentation.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/169401135/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wallysalami","id":2084188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODQxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2084188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami","html_url":"https://github.com/wallysalami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wallysalami/gists{/gist_i